e-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation web\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.inews365.com/news/article.html?no=654592\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\"충주 하나님의 교회, 문화동 저소득 가정에 식료품 전달\"</a>. 《충북일보》. 2021. 2. 7.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=%EC%B6%A9%EB%B6%81%EC%9D%BC%EB%B3%B4&amp;rft.atitle=%22%EC%B6%A9%EC%A3%BC+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C%2C+%EB%AC%B8%ED%99%94%EB%8F%99+%EC%A0%80%EC%86%8C%EB%93%9D+%EA%B0%80%EC%A0%95%EC%97%90+%EC%8B%9D%EB%A3%8C%ED%92%88+%EC%A0%84%EB%8B%AC%22&amp;rft.chron=2021.+2.+7.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.inews365.com%2Fnews%2Farticle.html%3Fno%3D654592&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fchurchofgod.wiki%3A%EC%B6%A9%EC%A3%BC+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C\"><span style=\"display:none;\"> </span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><cite class=\"citation\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.goodmorningcc.com/news/articleView.html?idxno=37062\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">“서울·대전·서산·충주·청주… 하나님의 교회 '사랑의 릴레이<span style=\"padding-right:0.2em;\">'</span>”</a>, 《굿모닝충청》, 2016. 2. 5.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=%EA%B5%BF%EB%AA%A8%EB%8B%9D%EC%B6%A9%EC%B2%AD&amp;rft.atitle=%EC%84%9C%EC%9A%B8%C2%B7%EB%8C%80%EC%A0%84%C2%B7%EC%84%9C%EC%82%B0%C2%B7%EC%B6%A9%EC%A3%BC%C2%B7%EC%B2%AD%EC%A3%BC%E2%80%A6+%ED%95%98%EB%82%98%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%98+%EA%B5%90%ED%9A%8C+%27%EC%82%AC%EB%9E%91%EC%9D%98+%EB%A6%B4%EB%A0%88%EC%9D%B4%27&amp;rft.chron=2016.+2.+5.&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.goodmorningcc.com%2Fnews%2FarticleView.html%3F